{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》昨晚播出第9集《女神2》，「水上騎膊馬」大混戰除揭示7大女神的戰鬥力，還有求愛勇者與男女相處時特質，當中以俞鋆瑞（Ice）對異性的「零邊界感」最引發爭議。</p><p>事緣，原本與陳星妤Yvette一組的Ice，為了爭勝而不斷與Yvette咬耳仔，還幫Yvette按摩增加戰鬥力，令看在眼裏的郭珮文（阿Ju）打翻醋罈。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:41:34.699627+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:54:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.134961+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:38:30.011805+00:00","content_hash":"b085864cc9eb3bbe8ef313ec5e367b99a072ae001f61ee83db4cb0d1ff6577ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}